   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "When the verifier does not find a file on disk that it is expecting (e.g. it was deleted after import),  it fails correctly.  However a stacktrace is displayed in the output.  It would probably be more beautiful if FileNotFoundErrors we're caught and noted in the logs without a stacktrace bubbling up to the console.",
